posite to false, lying, denotes the actuality of a thing: ἀληθινός, its relation to the corresponding con­ception. (Cf. Tr., Syn., § viii; Cremer, 84 f., 631 Abbott, JV, 234 f.; DB, iv, 818 f.; MM, VGT, s.vv.) (AS)","source_line":329}],"occurrence_count":26,"observed_portuguese_glosses":[{"gloss":"verdadeiro","count":17},{"gloss":"verdade","count":4},{"gloss":"verdadeiramente","count":2},{"gloss":"verdadeira","count":2},{"gloss":"verdadeiros","count":1}]},"G2321":{"id":"G2321","source":"TBESG","entries":[{"source_id":"G2321","disambiguated_id":"G2321 =","unique_id":"G2321","headword":"Θεόφιλος","transliteration":"Theophilos","lexical_morphology":"N:N-M-P","gloss_en":"Theophilus","definition_en":"Θεόφιλος, -ου\n (θεός, φίλος), \nTheophilus: Luk.1:3, Act.1:1.†\n (AS)","source_line":2470}],"occurrence_count":2,"observed_portuguese_glosses":[{"gloss":"Teófilo","count":2}]},"G3127":{"id":"G3127","source":"TBESG","entries":[{"source_id":"G3127","disambiguated_id":"G3127 =","unique_id":"G3127","headword":"Μαναήν","transliteration":"Manaēn","lexical_morphology":"N:N-M-P","gloss_en":"Manaen","definition_en":"Μαναήν, ὁ (Heb. מְנַחֵם), \n Manaen: Act.13:1.†\n (AS)","source_line":3330}],"occurrence_count":1,"observed_portuguese_glosses":[{"gloss":"Manaem","count":1}]},"G370":{"id":"G370","source":"TBESG","entries":[{"source_id":"G0370","disambiguated_id":"G0370 =","unique_id":"G0370","headword":"ἀνάξιος","transliteration":"anaxios","lexical_morphology":"G:A","gloss_en":"unworthy","definition_en":"ἀν-άξιος, -ον\n (ἀ- neg., ἄξιος), [in LXX: Jer.15:19 א2 (זָלַל), Est.8:13, Sir.25:8 * ;] \nunworthy: with genitive, 1Co.6:2 (MM, VGT, see word).†\n (AS)","source_line":476}],"occurrence_count":1,"observed_portuguese_glosses":[{"gloss":"acaso","count":1}]},"G392":{"id":"G392","source":"TBESG","entries":[{"source_id":"G0392","disambiguated_id":"G0392 =","unique_id":"G0392","headword":"ἀνατάσσω","transliteration":"anatassō","lexical_morphology":"G:V","gloss_en":"to compile","definition_en